                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<p>
   <lb n="1"/>{5} ke {6}
   <lb n="2"/>{5} dhe {5}
   <lb n="3"/>{2} [dhūli] vraḥ pāda dhū[li jeṅ vraḥ] {3}
   <lb n="4"/>{3} śivaloka kā{6}
   <lb n="5"/>{3} jmaḥ vraḥ Aśvadiva ta vra[ḥ] {3}
   <lb n="6"/>{2}ra vraḥ kalpaṇā śvetatandu[la] {3}
   <lb n="7"/>{2} ta roh neh thve vraḥ kalpaṇā {3}
   <lb n="8"/>{1} na dhūli vraḥ pāda dhūli jeṅ vraḥ {2}
</p>     
</div>
